-- smucclaw/l4-ide#1074 (F3, ruled by Meng 2026-11-22: Clause Layout Rulings
-- F3 A): a LEST at or left of the column its definition starts at belongs to
-- no rule, and is refused naming the rule above it, with where to write it.

DECLARE Person IS ONE OF Seller, Buyer
DECLARE Action IS ONE OF delivery, payment

c MEANS
  PARTY Seller
  MUST delivery
  HENCE
    PARTY Buyer
    MUST payment
LEST BREACH BY Seller
